  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557648000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557656266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557660866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Can I get your full name and the order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557662866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Chen. Order number is... 987-554-3210.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557668799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. Pulling that up now... I see the order for the Aero-Dynamic Helmet. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557671866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a preference. The color is wrong. It's been sitting in the corner since it arrived. The box is unopened.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557684799998
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. One moment while I check the return eligibility for you... Okay, I see the helmet was delivered 65 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557692266664
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557700599997
    },
    {
      "text": "And you're well within our 90-day return window. I can absolutely process this return for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557701299997
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just do it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557708433330
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. And I see you're a VIP member with us, Alex. We truly appreciate your business. I've just processed the return authorization and sent a pre-paid shipping label to the email we have on file. Just attach that to the original package.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557710033330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557726366663
    },
    {
      "text": "As a small thank you for being a loyal customer, and to help you find a replacement, I've also added a $20 credit to your account. We want to ensure you get the perfect gear that combines both style and, most importantly, safety.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557727066663
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. I guess that's something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59165,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557742533329
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Once we receive the original helmet, we'll issue a full refund to your original payment method. Was there anything else I could assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769557744799995
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
